{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":216776,"name":"","username":"YongZhao","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.developer.atlassian.com/yongzhao/{size}/55425_2.png","created_at":"2025-12-14T23:20:04.006Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi guys,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI am considering publishing a paid app on the Atlassian Marketplace and would like to clarify the eligibility requirements for individual developers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI came across the Partner Due Diligence guidelines listed here:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://developer.atlassian.com/platform/marketplace/partner-due-diligence/\"\u003eDue diligence business and identity verification for Marketplace Partners\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ewhich reference business and identity verification for Marketplace partners.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCould you please confirm whether an \u003cstrong\u003eindividual developer without a registered company\u003c/strong\u003e is eligible to publish and sell \u003cstrong\u003epaid apps\u003c/strong\u003e on the Atlassian Marketplace?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf this is supported, could you outline any specific requirements or documentation needed for individual publishers under the current due diligence process?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you in advance for your guidance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBest regards\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2025-12-15T02:23:00.700Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":64,"reads":72,"readers_count":71,"score":349.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":97755,"topic_slug":"does-atlassian-no-longer-support-individual-developers-publishing-apps","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://developer.atlassian.com/platform/marketplace/partner-due-diligence/","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":7},{"url":"https://community.developer.atlassian.com/t/does-trello-support-individual-developers-publishing-power-ups-in-the-market/100277","internal":true,"reflection":true,"title":"Does Trello support individual developers publishing Power-Ups in the market?","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":42678,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/does-atlassian-no-longer-support-individual-developers-publishing-apps/97755/1","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":220700,"name":"","username":"YongZhao","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.developer.atlassian.com/yongzhao/{size}/55425_2.png","created_at":"2026-03-02T08:32:49.550Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eAtlassian confirmed that small and independent teams are welcome, but all Marketplace partners must provide a registered business entity for Partner Verification. Accounts set up only as individuals typically do not meet the requirements.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA registered business entity is required to pass Partner Verification, even for small teams.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIndividual developers without a business entity generally cannot publish apps or sell/monetize them.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-03-02T08:32:49.550Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_num